# Generated by `node experiments/formal_ai_subagent/apply-notation-rules.mjs --family <name> --write`; checked by its --check.
#
# Every name a notation rule pass renamed, per family of
# data/meta/notation-rules.lino: the old spelling, then the new one. The check fails
# when a reader holds an old spelling again. This file keeps the old
# spellings on purpose, so scripts/measure-notation.mjs does not count it.
